# Frontend

For new UI or restyles: load `frontend-design` (aesthetic) and `frontend-designer` (implementation). For Stitch screens: `taste-design` + `design-md` + the matching `stitch-*` skill. For component libraries: `shadcn-ui` / `react-components`.

Avoid generic Inter/purple-gradient/card-grid slop. Pick one aesthetic and execute it.
